<title>BELGIUM: TABLE - BIL H1 1997 RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TABLE - BIL H1 1997 RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in billions of Luxembourg francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit		 1.811  vs	1.613</p>
<p>    Total assets		1,051	vs    934</p>
<p>    Deposits			726	vs    633</p>
<p>NOTE - Banque Internationale a Luxembourg, majority-owned by</p>
<p>Belgian-French Dexia group, said in a</p>
<p>statement that first-half results should mean that full-year</p>
<p>1997 results would be higher than in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
